<h1>layer_get_all</h1>
<p>This function will return an <a href="../../../../GML_Overview/Arrays.htm">array</a> populated with the unique ID values of each layer in the room.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code">layer_get_all()</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Array"><a target="_blank" href="../../../../GML_Overview/Arrays.htm">Array</a></span> (populated with Layer IDs)</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">var a = layer_get_all();<br/>
for (var i = 0; i &lt; array_length(a); i++;)<br/>
{<br/>
    layer_destroy(a[i]);<br/>
}</p>
<p>The above code retrieves all the layers in a room and adds their ID values to an array. This array is then parsed to destroy or the room layers.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
